WHAT? I beg to differ - it's one of the *best* features of NetHack. It
forces the player to push forward as he gets stronger, not just sit
around using some spoiler to become a 20th-level character on the 1st
level and then just cruise through 10 or 20 levels. So the game doesn't
reward mindless drudgery by people with oddles of time on their hands,
it instead rewards boldness and risktaking. This is a Good Thing.


